{"id":"1f8fee89a8d4aa2f","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded.md","title":"Kolmogorov Complexity Unbounded","display":"prop-kolmogorov-unbounded — Kolmogorov Complexity Unbounded","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded","aliases":["90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded"],"display":"prop-kolmogorov-unbounded — Kolmogorov Complexity Unbounded","depends_on":["[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-kolmogorov-unbounded — Kolmogorov Complexity Unbounded"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d83e22f672cfb25\" href=\"?note=7d83e22f672cfb25\" title=\"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity\">90-df-kolmogorov-complexity</a> 断言中的谓词；该文件同时保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 对所有有限字串有定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> (fixed optimal prefix-free universal machine)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(K_U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (prefix-free Kolmogorov complexity)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}unbounded}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\nK_U(s)&gt;n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}unbounded}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\nK_U(s)&gt;n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制程序共有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{j=0}^n2^j=2^{n+1}-1\">\\(\\sum_{j=0}^n2^j=2^{n+1}-1\\)</span> 个，其终止输出至多这么多个。长度恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+1\">\\(n+1\\)</span> 的字串有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n+1}\">\\(2^{n+1}\\)</span> 个，故其中至少一个未被这些程序输出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 的全性保证它仍有某个程序描述，且最短描述长度大于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>长度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制程序只有有限多个，因而它们只能输出有限多个字符串；选择未被这些程序输出的字符串即可。</li>\n<li>结论针对字符串复杂度，与上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_U\">\\(K_U\\)</span> 的类型一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-kolmogorov-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"7d83e22f672cfb25","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$ 是 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]] 断言中的谓词；该文件同时保证 $K_U$ 对所有有限字串有定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false},{"tex":"U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"K_U:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}kolmogorov\\text{-}unbounded}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\nK_U(s)>n.","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{j=0}^n2^j=2^{n+1}-1","display":false},{"tex":"n+1","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"K_U","display":false}],"bytes":1368,"backlinks":[{"id":"5cc312c6e3fc50d2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$、$K_U$ 见 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]；无界性见 [[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]。"},{"id":"8959cc2a17246321","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OptimalPrefix}(U)$、$K_U$ 见 [[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity]]；无界性见 [[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded]]。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-prop-creative-complete.md]]\n[[90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded.md]]\n[[90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger.md]]\n[[90-prop-representability-criterion.md]]\n[[90-prop-rosser-sentence.md]]\n[[90-prop-simple-immune.md]]"}],"outgoing":["7d83e22f672cfb25"]}